          <h2 class="section-title">Neural processing at the edge</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>MEAICON's edge AI inference platforms bring dedicated neural processing units directly to the edge — enabling on-device model inference for driver-behavior analysis, video safety processing, anomaly detection, and predictive maintenance. By processing data locally without routing through the cloud, the platform eliminates the 200–300ms round-trip latency that makes conventional telematics unsuitable for time-critical safety applications.</p>
          <p>The architecture integrates deep protocol support spanning CAN bus, J1939, BACnet, Modbus, OBD2, and serial interfaces — unifying vehicle, building, and industrial protocol ecosystems on one platform. Built-in dual-camera capture is processed on-device by the neural engine, enabling driver safety, security monitoring, and visual verification with no cloud-routed video required.</p>
